bin/
obj/
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# The translated corpus never lives in this repository. It is a derivative of the game's own text, it
# is hundreds of MB, and it changes on a completely different cadence from the code. The plugin loads
# it at runtime from the plugin config directory instead -- see CORPUS.md.
# Data/* rather than Data/, so the negation below is reachable: git does not descend into an ignored
# directory, and !Data/sample-corpus.json under a bare `Data/` would never be considered.
Data/*
!Data/sample-corpus.json
es.json
corpus.json
corpus-*.json

# Diagnostic output, written into the plugin config directory at runtime. Only ever appears here if
# someone points the plugin at the source tree.
misses.jsonl

# Downscaled proofs emitted alongside the icon when it is regenerated. They exist to check the icon
# survives being shown at 32px in the plugin installer; only images/icon.png is shipped.
images/preview-*.png
